# Sketch On Face from the context menu: the top face of the extrusion of
# path_extrude, right-clicked, offers Sketch On Face, which makes the
# same group as the Features menu; Sketch In New Workplane with the face
# selected makes it too.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
popup Sketch On Face
down R 290 265
up R 290 265
dump
key z ctrl
view default
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Sketch In New Workplane
dump
